<title>INDIA: India's Goetze 96/97 6-mth net at 127 mln.</title>
<headline>India's Goetze 96/97 6-mth net at 127 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to September, 1996</p>
<p>		(in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     127.0 vs  84.5</p>
<p>    Sales		  1,181.4 vs 884.7</p>
<p>    Other income	   106.4 vs  43.6</p>
<p>    Total expenditure  1,008.1 vs 750.9</p>
<p>    Interest		  85.8 vs  47.0</p>
<p>    Depreciation	    40.4 vs  23.9</p>
<p>    Tax			 26.5 vs  22.0</p>
<p>Note: Goetze (India) Ltd is a part of the Escorts group and makes automobile components. It said in a statement that the unaudited results were approved at a meeting of the board of directors of the company on Monday.</p>
<p>--  New Delhi newsroom, 91-11-301 2024</p>
</text>
